WEBVTT

00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:34.560
The time has come,

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:38.890
Brother.

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:49.980
Yes...

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:59.890
Let the vengeance begin.

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:17.590
For the future of us founders.

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:09.040
<i>Eve...</i>

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:12.780
<i>Wake up, Eve.</i>

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:16.500
Eve?

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:39.510
<i>The time has come, Eve.</i>

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:42.920
<i>Eve.</i>

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.290
Who...

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:50.750
Who are you?!

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:01.150
A dream?

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:07.580
You're finally awake.

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:09.610
Huh?!

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:16.040
Please, don't cry out so loudly. 
You're too noisy.

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:17.350
Right, Teddy?

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:21.570
Seriously. You're so melodramatic, Little Bitch.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:26.020
Hey, Pancake! I just woke up,
and I'm thirsty as hell.

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:27.740
Let me suck your blood.

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:29.910
Ayato-kun, you can't just suddenly...

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:34.080
Ayato, we won't allow you to have all the fun.

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:35.360
Kanato-kun...

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:39.490
Yeah, Ayato-kun. No keeping her to yourself.

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:40.250
Raito-kun...

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:44.460
After all, Bitch-chan's blood 
belongs to everybody.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:45.760
Right?

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:51.640
C'mon, let me have it already, Pancake.

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:55.390
Please hurry and quench my thirst.

00:04:55.740 --> 00:04:59.770
Let's all do something fun, Little Bitch.

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:08.870
This, so early in the morning?

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:11.120
Disgraceful.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:14.360
Jeez, just when it was getting good.

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:18.260
I agree... What gives you the right?

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:20.880
You should've joined us, Reiji.

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:24.880
Little Bitch writhing in agony 
while we all swarm upon her...

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:28.890
Just thinking about it gets me excited.

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:32.060
Pervert.

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:38.650
Shut up. You're ruining my music.

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:40.800
You never change.

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:42.350
Why don't you be more honest?

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:43.400
Shut it.

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:45.150
Please, be quiet.

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:48.070
Can't you see you're upsetting Teddy?

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:51.670
Damn it all, I'm parched!

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:53.150
I can't take it any longer.

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:57.420
Ayato, this is not the place for such conduct.

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:57.580
Sorry, Teddy...

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:58.500
You should be ashamed.

00:05:59.010 --> 00:06:00.780
Shut up and stop getting in my way!

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:02.140
Such a nuisance.

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:03.000
What was that?!

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:07.700
Well, we are cramped inside 
a car at the moment.

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:09.480
Don't make a fuss, Ayato-kun.

00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:10.770
I'll do what I want!

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:14.200
It's all your fault.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:16.340
Me?

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:43.460
What is this?

00:06:46.980 --> 00:06:49.580
You're heavy, you know.

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:52.470
Thank you for saving me, Ayato-kun.

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:56.970
Whatever. I just didn't want to lose your blood.

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:04.770
What happened? Was it an accident?

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:07.580
Don't be absurd.

00:07:07.580 --> 00:07:10.030
The car was driven by a familiar.

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:13.150
Looks like this was no accident.

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:16.040
Then what was it?

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:18.500
Maybe it was them.

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:47.820
Who the hell are you?!

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:57.700
Eve.

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:04.330
Hey!

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:10.400
Who were they?

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:15.840
Their scent...

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:18.470
It stinks.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:22.530
It would seem they're like us.

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:24.720
You mean...

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:27.730
However, they don't seem to be purebloods.

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:31.990
This might get annoying.

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:35.990
I see... So it's a declaration of war.

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:37.910
Sounds like fun!

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:44.990
<i>That voice... I've heard it before...</i>

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.900
I can't sleep at all.

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:15.180
What was that about?

00:09:16.980 --> 00:09:18.820
It's still on my mind...

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:20.280
Eve.

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:37.660
Found you!

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:41.760
Wh-Who are you?!

00:09:45.970 --> 00:09:48.350
Good morning, masochistic kitten.

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:56.000
Whoa, there.

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:00.160
Don't run from us, you sow.

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:02.670
You...

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:08.490
You smell... just like me...

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:13.460
No!

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:25.060
<i>Eternal life...</i>

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:27.220
<i>Fate...</i>

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.970
<i>A promise exchanged...</i>

00:10:38.550 --> 00:10:39.600
<i>Eve...</i>

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:43.190
<i>The new Eve.</i>

00:10:54.490 --> 00:10:57.090
Eve. I've come for you.

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:10.990
<i>I will...</i>

00:11:15.220 --> 00:11:17.280
<i>entrust everything to you.</i>

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:22.740
I don't have anyone special.

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:26.430
Just shut up and let me suck your 
blood like the prey you are.

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:29.890
I'll instill it in you as often as it takes...

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:33.750
I won't let anyone else have you. Never.

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:38.770
You belong to me, and I'll remind 
you as often as I have to.
